#title[Inference, controls & qualification]
Public recovery witnesses and exact retained reference agreement are positive finite evidence for these fixed inputs. They do not identify exact full-function density or transfer to arbitrary curve families. No full-orbit recovery census ran in this audit.

The conditional uniform law is min(M,r−1)/(r−1), for distinct nonzero guesses; M-determination remains paid candidate work. Six cells share targets, blindings and traces. Domain separation is not independent scientific replication.

#sub[Controls and branch coverage]
Independent reconstruction agrees on all 24,552 orientations and 73,728 uniform rows. Fixed public/retained sensitivity controls detect wrong streams, anchors, multiplicities, duplicate/zero guesses, false scalar/conversion and bookkeeping mutations. The declared ideal-hash model is a premise: byte agreement does not prove physical entropy, late seed generation or iid stages. Retained saturation, raw hash rejection, orientation duplicates and ineligible/degenerate masks were not observed; toy boundaries do not certify those production branches.

#sub[Missing historical witness and custody]
All 1,536 BSGS final scalars verify. Retained rows omit baby tables, giant sequences and collision(i,j); independently derived indices are not original witnesses. Earlier full truth-audit invocations lack captured code hashes. Later available code/hashes remain preserved without inventing earlier custody. Law's recovered executed source and root comparison, and cost's before/after captures, are distinct facts.

#sub[Complete costs remain unknown]
Native worker replay, full host-verifier process work, simultaneous cache/RSS/representation bytes, interpreter/integer/I/O, energy/currency and qualified clocks are absent or unqualified. A complete primitive-count target is legitimate without clocks; clock claims need qualified clocks. Expected retry cost requires iid complete restarts, q>0 and finite complete cost; heterogeneous sampled hit fractions do not supply these premises.

Native *invalid_output/check1/publishedfalse* stays unchanged. The YAML/strictJSON completed-manifest mismatch is operational; a later typed bridge does not rewrite the old status. Old source-PDF inspection and blind-reference inconclusive records remain historical. Goal active / H specified / IDEA proposed stay unchanged.

